               <text>
                  <paragraph>Leucovorin Calcium Tablets USP</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">25 mg tablets are supplied as a peach colored, round, biconvex tablet; debossed with “ING” above “184” on one side and scoreline on other side.</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Cartons of 20 tablets (10 tablets each blister pack x 2), NDC 0904-7584-10 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>WARNING: This Unit Dose package is not child resistant and is Intended for Institutional Use Only. Keep this and all drugs out of the reach of children.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Store at 20° to 25°C (68° to 77°F). [See USP Controlled Room Temperature.] Protect From Light and Moisture.</paragraph>
